--Description: 9) Among the qualified Cyprus / IMAGE / VERIFIED / Health ads that ran in Croatia in 2023 with tsa_date IS NULL and no “CRITERIA_UNUSED”, return the page-URL of the ad having the highest times_shown_upper_bound.
